{"schemaVersion":"1.0.0","readme":"","modules":[{"kind":"javascript-module","path":"src/change-review.ts","declarations":[{"kind":"class","description":"Review proposed edits hunk by hunk — accept or reject each, then take the result — as the AI-edit review of an\neditor or the \"suggested changes\" of a code review. Set `original` and `modified`: the element diffs them by line\nand word (with `@c2n/diff-viewer`'s diff) and groups each run of changed lines into a hunk, with `context`\nunchanged lines around it.\n\nEach hunk shows its removed and added lines with the changed words highlighted, and an Accept / Reject pair. An\naccepted hunk collapses to its new text, a rejected one to its original text, both with an Undo. The sticky review\nbar shows the position (\"Hunk 2 of 5 · 3 left\"), Previous and Next, and Accept all / Reject all, which decide every\nhunk still open. Once every hunk is decided the bar turns into a summary with Start over and the `actions` slot,\nwhere the app puts its own Apply button: the element never writes anything back.\n\n`decisions` holds one `'accepted' | 'rejected' | null` per hunk and can be set to restore a review; `result` is the\ntext the decisions produce, an open hunk keeping its `undecided` side. `review-change` fires after every decision\nand `review-complete` each time the last open hunk is decided.\n\nKeyboard, inside the element: Alt+ArrowDown and Alt+ArrowUp move between hunks, Ctrl+Enter (⌘Enter) accepts the\ncurrent hunk and Ctrl+Backspace (⌘Backspace) rejects it; every shortcut is also a button whose tooltip names it.\nThe host is a `group` named by `label`; each hunk is a group named \"Change 2 of 5: 3 lines removed, 4 added\", and\ndecisions are announced politely. A text diff with no syntax highlighting; editing inside a hunk is out of scope.","name":"ChangeReview","cssProperties":[{"type":{"text":"background-color"},"name":"--c2-change-review--background-color","default":"#ffffff"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-change-review--color","default":"#18181b"},{"type":{"text":"border"},"name":"--c2-change-review--border","default":"1px solid #e4e4e7"},{"type":{"text":"border-radius"},"name":"--c2-change-review--border-radius","default":"8px"},{"type":{"text":"pixel"},"description":"Past this height the hunks scroll under the sticky bar.","name":"--c2-change-review--max-height","default":"none"},{"type":{"text":"font-family"},"name":"--c2-change-review--font-family","default":"inherit"},{"type":{"text":"font-size"},"description":"Size of the header, bar and hunk titles.","name":"--c2-change-review--font-size","default":"14px"},{"type":{"text":"padding"},"name":"--c2-change-review__header--padding","default":"10px 14px"},{"type":{"text":"border"},"name":"--c2-change-review__header--border-bottom","default":"1px solid #e4e4e7"},{"type":{"text":"font-weight"},"description":"Weight of the label.","name":"--c2-change-review__header--font-weight","default":"600"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"description":"The file name.","name":"--c2-change-review__file--color","default":"#71717a"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-change-review__stats__added--color","default":"#15803d"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-change-review__stats__removed--color","default":"#dc2626"},{"type":{"text":"background-color"},"name":"--c2-change-review__bar--background-color","default":"#fafafa"},{"type":{"text":"border"},"name":"--c2-change-review__bar--border-bottom","default":"1px solid #e4e4e7"},{"type":{"text":"padding"},"name":"--c2-change-review__bar--padding","default":"8px 12px"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"description":"The filled share of the progress meter.","name":"--c2-change-review__meter--color","default":"rgb(2, 101, 220)"},{"type":{"text":"background-color"},"name":"--c2-change-review__meter--background-color","default":"#e4e4e7"},{"type":{"text":"background-color"},"description":"The summary once every hunk is decided.","name":"--c2-change-review__done--background-color","default":"rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.08)"},{"type":{"text":"background-color"},"name":"--c2-change-review__done-icon--background-color","default":"#16a34a"},{"type":{"text":"border"},"name":"--c2-change-review__hunk--border","default":"1px solid #e4e4e7"},{"type":{"text":"border-radius"},"name":"--c2-change-review__hunk--border-radius","default":"6px"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"description":"Outline of the current hunk.","name":"--c2-change-review__hunk__current--border-color","default":"rgb(2, 101, 220)"},{"type":{"text":"background-color"},"name":"--c2-change-review__hunk-head--background-color","default":"#fafafa"},{"type":{"text":"margin"},"name":"--c2-change-review__hunk--margin","default":"8px 12px"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"description":"Hunk titles, gap rows and collapsed lines.","name":"--c2-change-review__muted--color","default":"#52525b"},{"type":{"text":"font-family"},"name":"--c2-change-review__code--font-family","default":"ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace"},{"type":{"text":"font-size"},"name":"--c2-change-review__code--font-size","default":"12px"},{"type":{"text":"line-height"},"name":"--c2-change-review__code--line-height","default":"20px"},{"type":{"text":"background-color"},"name":"--c2-change-review__line__added--background-color","default":"rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.12)"},{"type":{"text":"background-color"},"name":"--c2-change-review__line__removed--background-color","default":"rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.12)"},{"type":{"text":"background-color"},"name":"--c2-change-review__word__added--background-color","default":"rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.3)"},{"type":{"text":"background-color"},"name":"--c2-change-review__word__removed--background-color","default":"rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.3)"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-change-review__marker__added--color","default":"#15803d"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-change-review__marker__removed--color","default":"#dc2626"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-change-review__line-number--color","default":"#52525b"},{"type":